eme. Huge con is it's practically dead, unless you have up to 3 other friends to play it with. Other than that, totally worth your time.", "timestamp_created": 1444104188, "timestamp_updated": 1444104188, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "18344646", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992806152", "personaname": "Razor", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Blackrazor/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 131, "playtime_forever": 893, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 888, "last_played": 1495551460, "avatar": "edf7c37f0fc74b33edb5367b97cbbd9ce21e94ff"}, "language": "english", "review": "Why isnt there a new expansion/game based on this? Why isnt there DLC, why no workshop? Valve is great, DOTA is great but you seriously need to hire more developers and make more games...\n\nThis is an awesome game and a wasted opportunity, 5 years since it came out and nothing has been done with it, and IT IS awesome.", "timestamp_created": 1444070221, "timestamp_updated": 1444070221, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504950523376464844", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}